Finding a home that combines practical layouts, open spaces and everyday amenities requires looking beyond the apartment itself. CRC Sublimis, located in Sector 1, Greater Noida West, is a residential development by CRC Group offering 2 BHK and 3 BHK configurations along with a range of indoor and outdoor facilities. The project is registered under UP RERA No. UPRERAPRJ15180.

The development has been designed by architect Hafeez Contractor, with attention given to apartment layouts, open spaces and the wider residential environment. Its planning brings together homes, landscaped areas, recreational facilities and community spaces within one development.

Home Configurations at CRC Sublimis
One of the practical aspects of CRC Sublimis is the range of layouts available for different household requirements. The official project page lists 2 BHK, 2 BHK + Study, 3 BHK with 2 toilets, and 3 BHK with 3 toilets configurations.

The listed 2 BHK configuration has a total sale area of 982 sq. ft., while the 2 BHK + Study configuration is listed at 1,170 sq. ft. The 3 BHK options include 1,305 sq. ft. and 1,485 sq. ft. sale-area configurations.

There is also a ground-floor 3 BHK layout listed with a 530 sq. ft. private garden. This provides an additional outdoor area connected to the residence and offers a different layout option for buyers who prefer private open space.

