A Location Designed Around Everyday Connectivity
CRC Sublimis is situated in Sector 1, Greater Noida West. According to CRC Group’s official project information, the development is approximately two minutes from the FNG Expressway, three minutes from Yatharth Hospital and five minutes from schools including DPS, Lotus Valley and Ryan International.

The same project page lists Sector 76 Metro Station at approximately ten minutes, Gaur City Mall at approximately ten minutes and Mall of India and Sector 18, Noida, at approximately twenty minutes by drive. These timings are project-provided estimates, so actual travel times can vary depending on traffic and route conditions.

For families, proximity to schools and healthcare facilities can be particularly relevant. Working professionals may also consider access to major roads and public transportation when assessing whether a location suits their daily routine.

